            "text": "colour change"
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": " to Colour B begins the sides. The colour split sits exactly at the basket waist for a clean stripe."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Super-chunky rope in two contrasting colours on a 10 mm hook. Total yardage is around 100 m A (base) and 150 m B (sides)."
